; ericka-ai.com zone — source of truth
; Hosted at: Vercel DNS (team valentin-dobrevs-projects)
; Verified drift-free against live DNS: 2026-11-20
; Do NOT re-add Vercel-managed ALIAS records (root/wildcard) — they shadow
; the Hetzner A records and caused the Oct 2026 apex 404 incident.

$ORIGIN ericka-ai.com.
$TTL 60

; --- Hetzner (crm, 188.245.192.204) ---
@                 60    IN  A      188.245.192.204
www               60    IN  A      188.245.192.204
plumbers          60    IN  A      188.245.192.204
app               60    IN  A      188.245.192.204
n8n               60    IN  A      188.245.192.204

; --- Zoho Mail (val@ericka-ai.com) ---
@                 3600  IN  MX     10 mx.zoho.com.
@                 3600  IN  MX     20 mx2.zoho.com.
@                 3600  IN  MX     50 mx3.zoho.com.
@                 60    IN  TXT    "v=spf1 include:zohomail.com ~all"
zmail._domainkey  60    IN  TXT    "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQCuG/GGDAGQ+ufEI/BYA1MQwGpfyqpMMytlP4APdb1pREt29S4okZptn+41wT0tbSvOpycJWxIa0WK2Z6Oa7ZsXPn/X7Xbny/zKlH+UsXQRamRCE+ulgGItUjFHsO1mWUSMK6hJzMWGD7dRA/AobtxWyfh4XzXgfm3A3mya7YyS6wIDAQAB"
_dmarc            60    IN  TXT    "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:val@ericka-ai.com"

; --- Mailgun block REMOVED 2026-11-20 ---
; GHL-era sending domain was deleted: no references in CRM/n8n, GHL replaced,
; Mailgun account inaccessible (paywalled = inactive). If email sending is
; ever needed, use Resend (blocker #8) and merge its SPF into the apex record.

; --- CAA (letsencrypt.org is what Caddy uses) ---
@                 60    IN  CAA    0 issue "letsencrypt.org"
@                 60    IN  CAA    0 issue "pki.goog"
@                 60    IN  CAA    0 issue "sectigo.com"

; NOT copied on purpose: the two Vercel-managed ALIAS records
; (root -> vercel-dns-017, wildcard * -> vercel-dns-016). They point at Vercel.
